Research agent for deep codebase exploration and architectural analysis.
Use for understanding code structure, finding dependencies, and analyzing design patterns.
Invocation policy (strict): Only run research if the user explicitly requests it. Do NOT auto-invoke.
When to use the research agent (only after explicit user request):
- Deep codebase exploration and understanding
- Finding dependencies and architectural patterns
- Analyzing code structure without making changes
- Researching best practices and external resources
When NOT to use:
- Opening a single, known file path \u2014 use Read instead
- Examining only one or two specific files \u2014 direct Read/grep calls are more efficient
- Actions requiring writes or file generation \u2014 this agent is READ-ONLY
